{{> studentTop}}
<div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR EFFORT, RECOGNISED</p><h1>My achievements</h1><p class="muted">Keep your certificates, badges and learning milestones together.</p></div></div><div class="notice info">Each completed attempt earns one certificate and one badge. Stars reflect the final score: 75–84% = 1, 85–94% = 2, 95–100% = 3. Credentials record platform course completion.</div>
<div class="grid cols-3">{{#each credentials}}<article class="card achievement"><div class="badge-display" aria-hidden="true">♜</div><div class="row"><span class="chip">Course completed</span><span class="stars" aria-label="{{stars}} stars">{{starsText}}</span></div><h2 class="space-top">{{courseTitle}}</h2><p class="small muted">Awarded to {{recipientName}}<br>{{date}} · Course version {{courseVersion}}<br>Final assessment: {{score}}%</p><div class="stack space-top"><a class="button full" href="/student/credentials/{{id}}/certificate">Download certificate · PDF ↓</a><a class="button secondary full" href="/student/credentials/{{id}}/badge">Download badge · SVG ↓</a><a class="small" href="/verify/{{id}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View credential verification ↗</a></div><p class="small muted space-top">Share the verification link only if you want others to see your name and course completion.</p></article>{{else}}<section class="card empty"><strong>Your first achievement is ahead.</strong>Complete all requirements and pass a course final assessment to unlock a certificate, badge and stars.<br><a class="button" href="/student/courses">Start learning →</a></section>{{/each}}</div>
{{> studentBottom}}
